{
  "self-assessment-biss-api": {
    "3": {
      "0": {
        "components": {
          "securitySchemes": {
            "User-Restricted": {
              "description": "HMRC supports OAuth 2.0 for authenticating [User-restricted](https://developer.service.hmrc.gov.uk/api-documentation/docs/authorisation/user-restricted-endpoints) API requests",
              "flows": {
                "authorizationCode": {
                  "authorizationUrl": "https://api.service.hmrc.gov.uk/oauth/authorize",
                  "refreshUrl": "https://api.service.hmrc.gov.uk/oauth/refresh",
                  "scopes": {
                    "read:self-assessment": "Grant read access",
                    "write:self-assessment": "Grant write access"
                  },
                  "tokenUrl": "https://api.service.hmrc.gov.uk/oauth/token"
                }
              },
              "type": "oauth2"
            }
          }
        },
        "info": {
          "description": "# Send fraud prevention data\nHMRC monitors transactions to help protect your customers' confidential data from criminals and fraudsters. \n\n<div class=\"govuk-warning-text warning-icon-fix\">\n  <span class=\"govuk-warning-text__icon warning-icon-ui-fix\" aria-hidden=\"true\">!</span>\n  <strong class=\"govuk-warning-text__text\">\n    <span class=\"govuk-warning-text__assistive\">Warning</span>\n    You are required by law to submit header data for this API. This includes all associated APIs and endpoints.\n  </strong>\n</div>\n\n[Check the data you need to send](/guides/fraud-prevention/). You can also use the [Test API](/api-documentation/docs/api/service/txm-fph-validator-api/1.0) during initial development and as part of your quality assurance checks.\n\n# Changelog\nYou can find the changelog in the [income-tax-mtd-changelog](https://github.com/hmrc/income-tax-mtd-changelog/#readme) GitHub wiki.\n\n\n# Support\n\n* Direct reports of bugs or errors in Production or Sandbox code, or queries about HMRC business functionality (such as how a specific field is used by HMRC or why it is needed) to the [Software Development Support Team (SDST)](https://developer.service.hmrc.gov.uk/developer/support).\n* Send queries or feedback related to the design of the APIs (including recommended changes) using the [income-tax-mtd-changelog](https://github.com/hmrc/income-tax-mtd-changelog/issues) GitHub page.\n* <a href=\"/contact/report-technical-problem?newTab=true&service=api-documentation-frontend\" target=\"_blank\">Is this page not working properly? (opens in new tab)</a>\n",
          "title": "Business Income Source Summary (MTD)",
          "version": "3.0"
        },
        "openapi": "3.0.3",
        "paths": {
          "/individuals/self-assessment/income-summary/{nino}/{typeOfBusiness}/{taxYear}/{businessId}": {
            "get": {
              "description": "This endpoint enables you to retrieve a running (year-to-date) summary of the income and expenditure for a \nspecified self-employment or property business during a tax year. \nA National Insurance number, business ID, tax year and type of business are required.\n\n<strong>\n  Note: From tax year 2025-26 onwards the following business types are no longer valid:\n    <ul>\n      <li>foreign-property-fhl-eea</li>\n      <li>uk-property-fhl</li>\n    </ul>\n</strong>\n\n### Test data\nScenario simulation using Gov-Test-Scenario headers is only available in the sandbox environment.\n\n| Header Value (Gov-Test-Scenario) | Scenario                                                      |\n|----------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------|\n| N/A - DEFAULT                    | Simulates success response with total, profit and loss values.|\n| NOT_FOUND                        | Simulates the scenario where no data is found.                |\n| NO_INCOME_SUBMISSIONS_EXIST      | Simulates the scenario where no income submissions exist.     |\n",
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "description": "National Insurance number, in the format `AA999999A`\n",
                  "in": "path",
                  "name": "nino",
                  "required": true,
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "TC663795B"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "description": "An identifier for the business, unique to the customer.<p>Must conform to the regular expression `^X[A-Z0-9]{1}IS[0-9]{11}$`\n",
                  "in": "path",
                  "name": "businessId",
                  "required": true,
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^X[A-Z0-9]{1}IS[0-9]{11}$",
                    "example": "XAIS12345678910"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "description": "The tax year to which the data applies. For example: 2022-23. The start year and end year must not span two tax years.\nThe minimum tax year is 2022-23. No gaps are allowed, for example, 2022-24 is not valid. (The minimum tax year in Sandbox is 2021-22.)\n",
                  "in": "path",
                  "name": "taxYear",
                  "required": true,
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "2022-23"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "description": "The type of business the summary calculation is for.\n\nLimited to the following possible values for tax years before 2025-26:\n\n- foreign-property-fhl-eea\n- foreign-property\n- uk-property\n- uk-property-fhl\n- self-employment\n\nLimited to the following possible values for tax year 2025-26 onwards:\n\n- foreign-property\n- uk-property\n- self-employment\n",
                  "in": "path",
                  "name": "typeOfBusiness",
                  "required": true,
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "foreign-property-fhl-eea",
                      "foreign-property",
                      "uk-property",
                      "uk-property-fhl",
                      "self-employment"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "description": "Specifies the response format and the version of the API to be used.\n",
                  "in": "header",
                  "name": "Accept",
                  "required": true,
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "application/vnd.hmrc.3.0+json"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "description": "An OAuth 2.0 Bearer Token with the *read:self-assessment* scope.\n",
                  "in": "header",
                  "name": "Authorization",
                  "required": true,
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "Bearer bb7fed3fe10dd235a2ccda3d50fb"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "description": "Only in sandbox environment. See Test Data table for all header values.\n",
                  "in": "header",
                  "name": "Gov-Test-Scenario",
                  "required": false,
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "-"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "responses": {
                "200": {
                  "content": {
                    "application/json": {
                      "examples": {
                        "Response for TY 2024-25 and before": {
                          "value": {
                            "loss": {
                              "net": 0,
                              "taxable": 35.1
                            },
                            "profit": {
                              "net": 20.2,
                              "taxable": 35.55
                            },
                            "total": {
                              "accountingAdjustments": -30,
                              "additions": 575.7,
                              "deductions": 60,
                              "expenses": 50,
                              "income": 100.35
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "Response for TY 2025-26 onwards": {
                          "value": {
                            "loss": {
                              "net": 0.01,
                              "taxable": 35.1
                            },
                            "outstandingBusinessIncome": 35.01,
                            "profit": {
                              "adjusted": 30.01,
                              "net": 20.2,
                              "taxable": 35.55
                            },
                            "total": {
                              "accountingAdjustments": -30.01,
                              "additions": 575.71,
                              "deductions": 60.01,
                              "expenses": 50.01,
                              "income": 100.35
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "schema": {
                        "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
                        "title": "Retrieve a Business Income Source Summary Response",
                        "description": "Retrieve a Business Income Source Summary Response",
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "total": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "description": "Object of total values.",
                            "properties": {
                              "income": {
                                "description": "The total income for the income source. The value must be between 0 and 99999999999.99 up to 2 decimal places.",
                                "type": "number",
                                "example": 100,
                                "minimum": 0,
                                "maximum": 99999999999.99,
                                "multipleOf": 0.01
                              },
                              "expenses": {
                                "description": "The total expenses for the income source. The value must be between -99999999999.99 and 99999999999.99 up to 2 decimal places.",
                                "type": "number",
                                "example": 50,
                                "minimum": -99999999999.99,
                                "maximum": 99999999999.99,
                                "multipleOf": 0.01
                              },
                              "additions": {
                                "description": "The total additions to net profit (or deduction to net loss). The value must be between -99999999999.99 and 99999999999.99 up to 2 decimal places.",
                                "type": "number",
                                "example": 5,
                                "minimum": -99999999999.99,
                                "maximum": 99999999999.99,
                                "multipleOf": 0.01
                              },
                              "deductions": {
                                "description": "The total deductions to net loss (or addition to net profit). The value must be between 0 and 99999999999.99 up to 2 decimal places.",
                                "type": "number",
                                "example": 60,
                                "minimum": 0,
                                "maximum": 99999999999.99,
                                "multipleOf": 0.01
                              },
                              "accountingAdjustments": {
                                "description": "Adjustment for change of accounting practice, for example, cash basis to accrual accounting. The value must be between -99999999999.99 and 99999999999.99 up to 2 decimal places.",
                                "type": "number",
                                "example": -30,
                                "minimum": -99999999999.99,
                                "maximum": 99999999999.99,
                                "multipleOf": 0.01
                              }
                            },
                            "required": [
                              "income",
                              "expenses"
                            ]
                          },
                          "profit": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "description": "Object of profit values.",
                            "properties": {
                              "net": {
                                "description": "The net profit of income source. The value must be between 0 and 99999999999.99 up to 2 decimal places.",
                                "type": "number",
                                "example": 20,
                                "minimum": 0,
                                "maximum": 99999999999.99,
                                "multipleOf": 0.01
                              },
                              "taxable": {
                                "description": "The taxable net profit of the income source. The value must be between 0 and 99999999999.99 up to 2 decimal places.",
                                "type": "number",
                                "example": 0,
                                "minimum": 0,
                                "maximum": 99999999999.99,
                                "multipleOf": 0.01
                              },
                              "adjusted": {
                                "description": "Profit including disallowable expenses and deducting non\u2011taxable income, before claiming capital allowances or making any further tax adjustments. The value must be between 0 and 99999999999.99 up to 2 decimal places. This field will only be returned for tax year 2025-26 and onwards.",
                                "type": "number",
                                "example": 30,
                                "minimum": 0,
                                "maximum": 99999999999.99,
                                "multipleOf": 0.01
                              }
                            },
                            "required": [
                              "net",
                              "taxable"
                            ]
                          },
                          "loss": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "description": "Object of loss values.",
                            "properties": {
                              "net": {
                                "description": "The net loss of income source. The value must be between 0 and 99999999999.99 up to 2 decimal places.",
                                "type": "number",
                                "example": 0,
                                "minimum": 0,
                                "maximum": 99999999999.99,
                                "multipleOf": 0.01
                              },
                              "taxable": {
                                "description": "The taxable net loss of the income source. The value must be between 0 and 99999999999.99 up to 2 decimal places.",
                                "type": "number",
                                "example": 35,
                                "minimum": 0,
                                "maximum": 99999999999.99,
                                "multipleOf": 0.01
                              }
                            },
                            "required": [
                              "net",
                              "taxable"
                            ]
                          },
                          "outstandingBusinessIncome": {
                            "description": "Any other business income not included in other fields. The value must be between 0 and 99999999999.99 up to 2 decimal places. This field will only be returned for tax year 2025-26 and onwards.",
                            "type": "number",
                            "example": 30,
                            "minimum": 0,
                            "maximum": 99999999999.99,
                            "multipleOf": 0.01
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "total",
                          "profit",
                          "loss"
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "description": "Success",
                  "headers": {
                    "Deprecation": {
                      "description": "The deprecation date/time for this endpoint.\n",
                      "required": false,
                      "schema": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "Sun, 01 Jan 2023 23:59:59 GMT"
                      }
                    },
                    "Link": {
                      "description": "URL of the documentation for the API.\n",
                      "required": false,
                      "schema": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "https://developer.service.hmrc.gov.uk/api-documentation/docs/api/service/self-assessment-biss-api"
                      }
                    },
                    "Sunset": {
                      "description": "The earliest date/time this endpoint will become unavailable after deprecation.\n",
                      "required": false,
                      "schema": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "Sun, 02 Jul 2023 23:59:59 GMT"
                      }
                    },
                    "X-CorrelationId": {
                      "description": "Unique ID for operation tracking\nString, 36 characters.\n",
                      "required": true,
                      "schema": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "c75f40a6-a3df-4429-a697-471eeec46435"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "400": {
                  "content": {
                    "application/json": {
                      "examples": {
                        "FORMAT_BUSINESS_ID": {
                          "description": "The format of the supplied Business ID field is not valid.\n",
                          "value": {
                            "code": "FORMAT_BUSINESS_ID",
                            "message": "The provided businessId is invalid"
                          }
                        },
                        "FORMAT_NINO": {
                          "description": "The format of the supplied NINO field is not valid.\n",
                          "value": {
                            "code": "FORMAT_NINO",
                            "message": "The provided NINO is invalid"
                          }
                        },
                        "FORMAT_TAX_YEAR": {
                          "description": "The format of the supplied taxYear value is not valid.\n",
                          "value": {
                            "code": "FORMAT_TAX_YEAR",
                            "message": "The provided tax year is invalid"
                          }
                        },
                        "FORMAT_TYPE_OF_BUSINESS": {
                          "description": "The format of the supplied type of business is not valid.\n",
                          "value": {
                            "code": "FORMAT_TYPE_OF_BUSINESS",
                            "message": "The provided typeOfBusiness is invalid"
                          }
                        },
                        "RULE_INCORRECT_GOV_TEST_SCENARIO": {
                          "description": "The request did not match any available Sandbox data. Check that the supplied Gov-Test-Scenario is correct for this endpoint version. This error will only be returned in the Sandbox environment.\n",
                          "value": {
                            "code": "RULE_INCORRECT_GOV_TEST_SCENARIO",
